      "text": "How are … the weapons of war perished, 2 Sam. 1:27. with the other hand held a weapon, Neh. 4:17. Wisdom is better than weapons of war, Eccl. 9:18. weapons of his indignation, Isa. 13:5 (2 Ne. 23:5). No weapon that is formed against thee shall prosper, Isa. 54:17 (3 Ne. 22:17; D&C 71:9; 109:25). I will turn back the weapons of war, Jer. 21:4. Thou art my battle axe and weapons, Jer. 51:20. draw near, even every man with his destroying weapon, Ezek. 9:1.",
