      "text": "arm them with … all manner of weapons, Mosiah 9:16 (Alma 2:12, 14; 43:18; 60:2; Morm. 6:9; Ether 10:27). did lay down the weapons of their rebellion, Alma 23:7. testimony … that they never would use weapons again, Alma 24:18 (56:6–7; 62:16). they buried their … weapons of war, Alma 24:19 (25:14; 26:32). many came forth and threw down their weapons, Alma 44:15 (44:6). they did lift their weapons of war to fight, Alma 51:18. slew … all those who would not yield up their weapons, Alma 52:25 (52:32). not entered into a covenant that they would not take their weapons, Alma 53:16. as many as were convinced did lay down their weapons, Hel. 5:51. ye must lay down your weapons, Morm. 7:4.",
